---
import SocialLinks from "./SocialLinks.astro";
---

<section id="top" class="pt-12 sm:pt-16">
  <h1 class="reveal reveal-1 font-sans text-[1.08rem] font-medium text-ink">
    hey, i'm elsa.
  </h1>

  <div
    class="reveal reveal-2 body mt-4 max-w-[40rem] space-y-4 text-[1.08rem] text-muted"
  >
    <p>
      20, dropped outta usc. not to "chase my dreams," exactly, but to chase a
      kind of freedom i've always wanted.
    </p>
    <p>
      currently head of growth & creative director @<a
        href="https://ditto.ai"
        class="link-accent"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">ditto</a
      >, a $10m backed consumer social + matchmaking agent for college students
      like me.
    </p>
    <p>
      been in this company for about a year. No prev startup experiences but I'm
      a strong believer that the next operating system for getting things done
      will be built around conversation, with AI agents serving as the execution
      layer.
    </p>
    <p>
      started in the space from the creative side, then drifted into execution,
      strategy, building. At this point, I don't really believe in staying in
      one lane. I want to be fluid and sit at the intersection of all of it,
      wherever the most interesting things are happening.
    </p>
  </div>

  <SocialLinks class="reveal reveal-3 mt-7" />
</section>
